    "detailed_description": "<h1>Victim Revealed!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633340/extras/b0512eab7fd35756c16003e0f2233a30.avif?t=1754150086\" width=500 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A no-nonsense anarchist who\u2019s used to trouble. This loudmouth rocker is abnormally good at keeping quiet, and her heavy boots are far more suited for kicking ass than running away. <br> <br>Full backstory's link available on our official X account: @playsummercamp</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633340/extras/c40f1ec9c6df6bde99a61a76709e39e9.avif?t=1754150086\" data-has-big width=800 height=72 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633340/extras/7ea6a9ff881c26c0e5d3a1daf057e018.poster.avif?t=1754150086\" width=600 height=46 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633340/extras/7ea6a9ff881c26c0e5d3a1daf057e018.webm?t=1754150086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633340/extras/7ea6a9ff881c26c0e5d3a1daf057e018.mp4?t=1754150086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633340/extras/2e57d6d2d62b1117033d4a9b7b1cfe26.avif?t=1754150086\" width=1600 height=72 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this asymmetric multiplayer horror experience; one player takes on the role of the <strong>Slasher,</strong> a terrifying killer and the remaining players, and\u00a0<strong>Victims; </strong>should escape from the campsite.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633340/extras/807ada1ba4b4b9b6f3f748cc0023d1be.poster.avif?t=1754150086\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633340/extras/807ada1ba4b4b9b6f3f748cc0023d1be.webm?t=1754150086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633340/extras/807ada1ba4b4b9b6f3f748cc0023d1be.mp4?t=1754150086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633340/extras/a996d47e7862f8d14c6049821858d848.avif?t=1754150086\" width=1600 height=72 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The Slasher never stops hunting. Track them. Trap them. Eliminate each victim without mercy. Unleash your inner maniac using brutal environmental kills.&quot;</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633340/extras/d86e519fc94b3ca674b1224bd935d9c5.avif?t=1754150086\" width=1600 height=72 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive at all costs. Search the map for key items, solve deadly puzzles, and repair your escape\u2014whether it\u2019s through a gate, a vehicle, or a desperate call to the police. Trust is fragile. Betrayal is always lurking.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633340/extras/0f79607638f61b3dcacf98d5558c9909.avif?t=1754150086\" width=1600 height=72 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sandbox Mode</strong> \u2014 Unlike traditional gameplay, Sandbox Mode offers a more relaxed, open-ended experience. Allows players to freely <i>explore</i> maps, <i>interact</i> without pressure and <i>create</i> their own scenarios and stories. Whether you're roleplaying a campfire gathering or just hanging out with friends, Sandbox Mode provides a space for creativity and fun.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633340/extras/a5f9b69d5323ad8ffb50f8b0a22774f2.poster.avif?t=1754150086\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633340/extras/a5f9b69d5323ad8ffb50f8b0a22774f2.webm?t=1754150086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633340/extras/a5f9b69d5323ad8ffb50f8b0a22774f2.mp4?t=1754150086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>   </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2>",
